                "source": "Sprout Social",
                "text": "With my friends, @repkevinhern and @RepCuellar, we introduced the Patient Access to Higher Quality Health Care Act of 2025, a bipartisan bill that will increase physician-owned hospitals and patient access to quality health care by eliminating needless regulations that prohibit physicians from owning and investing in medical facilities.\n\nRead more here: https://t.co/BxJWAdhy2N",
