                "source": "Sprout Social",
                "text": "This week, I announced the Patient Access to Higher Quality Health Care Act of 2025, it is a bipartisan bill that repeals limitations to the prohibition on certain physician referrals for hospitals, allowing physician-owned hospitals to expand or to be established. https://t.co/BktOU21OGT",
