                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Sprout Social",
                "text": "I introduced the Removing Burdens From Organ Donation Act with my colleagues @RepDelBene, @RepCarolMiller, and @RepJimCosta. This will moderinze and streamline the organ donation process by improving communication between hospitals and organ procurement organizations. \n\nWe were glad to have the support of many in the transplant community including @DaVita, @FME_Global, @UNOSNews, @SWTransplant, @mydnwest, @AOPOHQ, @ASNKidney, @ASTSChimera, @AST_info, @nkf, @KidneyPatients, @PKDFoundation, and @HomeDialysisOrg.\n\nRead more here: https://t.co/abhPHNVgoG",
                "text_lang": "en",
